{
  "info": {
    "name": "Brand Voice Agent — Platform MCP Integration",
    "description": "Complete API collection for platform team MCP server integration.\n\nPipeline Flow: Create Brand → Ingest → Ideate → Execute\n\nAll responses include realistic sample data.\n\nBase URL: Set {{baseUrl}} variable to your deployed Cloud Run URL.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://your-agent.run.app",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "brand_id",
      "value": "7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "profile_id",
      "value": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "brief_id",
      "value": "b2c3d4e5-f678-90ab-cdef-123456789012",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "pipeline_id",
      "value": "c3d4e5f6-7890-abcd-ef12-345678901234",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Container health check. Always returns 200 OK."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Agent 3 Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/execute/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["execute", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Health check for Agent 3 (Execution)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"agent\": \"agent3\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Brand Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Brand",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "Acme Corp",
                  "description": "(Required) Brand/Org name.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "brand_id",
                  "value": "org_12345",
                  "description": "(Optional) Pass your org_id here to use it as brand_id. If omitted, a UUID is auto-generated.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/brands/create",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["brands", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a new brand.\n\nPlatform Integration: Pass your org_id as brand_id to use it directly everywhere — no mapping table needed.\nIf brand_id is omitted, a UUID is auto-generated."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Brand Created (with org_id)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"org_12345\",\n  \"name\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-02-19T07:00:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Brand Resources",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/brands/{{brand_id}}/resources",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["brands", "{{brand_id}}", "resources"]
            },
            "description": "Deletes all generated resources (profiles, briefs, content) for a brand.\nDoes NOT delete the brand record itself."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Resources Deleted",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"message\": \"All brand resources discarded.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Agent 1 — Ingestion (Voice Profile)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ingest Text/URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"brand_name\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"input_type\": \"url\",\n  \"input_value\": \"https://acmecorp.com/about\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest"]
            },
            "description": "Unified ingestion endpoint. Accepts JSON (text/URL) or multipart/form-data (file).\n\nInput types: 'text' (raw text) or 'url' (website URL to scrape).\n\n⚠️ LATENCY: Takes 10-30 seconds. Set timeout ≥ 60s."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Voice Profile Generated",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"status\": \"DRAFT\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"tone\": {\n    \"primary\": \"Professional\",\n    \"secondary\": [\"Analytical\", \"Authoritative\"],\n    \"description\": \"Fact-based and direct communication that prioritizes clarity and precision.\"\n  },\n  \"dos\": [\n    \"Use active voice\",\n    \"Lead with data and evidence\",\n    \"Keep sentences under 20 words\"\n  ],\n  \"donts\": [\n    \"Avoid exclamation marks\",\n    \"Don't use jargon without context\",\n    \"Never start with questions\"\n  ],\n  \"best_match_examples\": [\n    {\n      \"example_id\": \"ex_1\",\n      \"text\": \"Our platform processes 10M transactions daily. Performance metrics show 99.9% uptime.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"example_id\": \"ex_2\",\n      \"text\": \"Data security follows ISO 27001 standards. All transmissions use AES-256 encryption.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"example_id\": \"ex_3\",\n      \"text\": \"Integration requires three steps: authentication, configuration, deployment.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"raw_json\": {},\n  \"profile_data\": {}\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 — Bad Input",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Missing required field: input_type\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Ingest File Upload (PDF/DOCX)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "(Required) PDF or DOCX file"
                },
                {
                  "key": "brand_id",
                  "value": "{{brand_id}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "(Required) Brand UUID from /brands/create"
                },
                {
                  "key": "brand_name",
                  "value": "Acme Corp",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "(Optional) Brand name"
                },
                {
                  "key": "skip_generation",
                  "value": "false",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "(Optional) If true, ingests file but skips profile generation"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest/upload",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest", "upload"]
            },
            "description": "Upload PDF/DOCX for voice profile extraction.\n\n⚠️ LATENCY: Takes 10-30 seconds for PDFs."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — File Ingested",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"status\": \"DRAFT\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"tone\": {\n    \"primary\": \"Professional\",\n    \"secondary\": [\"Analytical\"],\n    \"description\": \"Fact-based communication\"\n  },\n  \"dos\": [\"Use active voice\", \"Lead with data\"],\n  \"donts\": [\"Avoid exclamation marks\"],\n  \"best_match_examples\": [\n    { \"example_id\": \"ex_1\", \"text\": \"Our platform processes 10M transactions daily.\" },\n    { \"example_id\": \"ex_2\", \"text\": \"Data security follows ISO 27001 standards.\" },\n    { \"example_id\": \"ex_3\", \"text\": \"Integration requires three steps.\" }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Voice Profile by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest/profile/{{profile_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest", "profile", "{{profile_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve a voice profile by its UUID."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Profile Found",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"status\": \"DRAFT\",\n  \"profile_data\": {\n    \"tone\": {\n      \"primary\": \"Professional\",\n      \"secondary\": [\"Analytical\", \"Authoritative\"],\n      \"description\": \"Fact-based and direct communication\"\n    },\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"dos\": [\"Use active voice\", \"Lead with data\"],\n      \"donts\": [\"Avoid exclamation marks\", \"No jargon\"],\n      \"forbidden_phrases\": [\"leverage\", \"synergy\"],\n      \"preferred_vocabulary\": [\"empower\", \"transform\"]\n    },\n    \"best_match_examples\": [\n      { \"example_id\": \"ex_1\", \"text\": \"Our platform processes 10M transactions daily.\" },\n      { \"example_id\": \"ex_2\", \"text\": \"Data security follows ISO 27001 standards.\" },\n      { \"example_id\": \"ex_3\", \"text\": \"Integration requires three steps.\" }\n    ],\n    \"system_prompt\": \"You are a professional brand voice assistant...\",\n    \"stats\": {\n      \"total_feedback_events\": 0,\n      \"accept_count\": 0,\n      \"rewrite_count\": 0,\n      \"acceptance_rate\": 0.0\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 — Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Profile a1b2c3d4-... not found\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Brand Voice Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest/profiles/brand/{{brand_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest", "profiles", "brand", "{{brand_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get the most recent voice profile for a brand."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Brand Profile Found",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"status\": \"APPROVED\",\n  \"profile_data\": {\n    \"tone\": {\n      \"primary\": \"Professional\",\n      \"secondary\": [\"Analytical\"],\n      \"description\": \"Fact-based communication\"\n    },\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"dos\": [\"Use active voice\"],\n      \"donts\": [\"Avoid exclamation marks\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve Voice Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest/approve/{{profile_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest", "approve", "{{profile_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Promote a voice profile from DRAFT to APPROVED.\nThis is the authoritative 'Save' action."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Profile Approved",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"status\": \"APPROVED\",\n  \"message\": \"Profile approved successfully\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Voice Profile Rules",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"system_prompt\": \"You are a brand voice assistant focused on clarity.\",\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"dos\": [\"Use active voice\", \"Lead with data\"],\n    \"donts\": [\"Avoid exclamation marks\", \"No jargon\"]\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ingest/profile/{{profile_id}}/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ingest", "profile", "{{profile_id}}", "update"]
            },
            "description": "Update Phase 1 (Human) data for a profile. Allows editing system prompt and explicit rules."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Profile Updated",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Agent 2 — Ideation (Content Brief)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generate Content Brief",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"{{brand_id}}\",\n  \"topic\": \"AI in Healthcare\",\n  \"market\": \"Healthcare Technology\",\n  \"region\": \"North America\",\n  \"content_goal\": \"thought leadership\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ideation/ideate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ideation", "ideate"]
            },
            "description": "Agent 2: Generate a content brief for a topic.\n\nRequired: brand_id, topic\nOptional: market, region, content_goal\n\n⚠️ Safe to retry (idempotent via fingerprinting)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Brief Generated",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brief_id\": \"b2c3d4e5-f678-90ab-cdef-123456789012\",\n  \"content_brief\": {\n    \"target_audience\": \"Healthcare administrators evaluating AI adoption for clinical and operational workflows\",\n    \"seo_keywords\": [\n      \"AI diagnostics\",\n      \"healthcare AI\",\n      \"medical imaging AI\",\n      \"clinical decision support\",\n      \"FDA approved AI\"\n    ],\n    \"h2_outline\": [\n      \"AI Diagnostic Applications in Clinical Settings\",\n      \"Data Privacy and Compliance Considerations\",\n      \"Implementation Requirements and Integration Paths\",\n      \"ROI Metrics and Cost-Benefit Analysis\",\n      \"Future Outlook and Emerging Trends\"\n    ],\n    \"key_takeaways\": [\n      \"FDA has approved over 500 AI/ML-enabled medical devices as of 2025\",\n      \"Healthcare AI market projected to reach $45B by 2026\",\n      \"AI diagnostic tools reduce radiology reading time by 30-50%\",\n      \"Integration with existing EHR systems remains the primary adoption challenge\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"voice_profile_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"must_follow_voice\": true\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 — Missing Fields",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"brand_id is required\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Brief by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ideation/brief/{{brief_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ideation", "brief", "{{brief_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve a specific content brief by its UUID."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Brief Found",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brief_id\": \"b2c3d4e5-f678-90ab-cdef-123456789012\",\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"topic\": \"AI in Healthcare\",\n  \"content_brief_json\": {\n    \"target_audience\": \"Healthcare administrators\",\n    \"seo_keywords\": [\"AI diagnostics\", \"healthcare AI\"],\n    \"h2_outline\": [\"AI Diagnostic Applications\", \"Data Privacy\"],\n    \"key_takeaways\": [\"FDA approved 500+ AI devices\"]\n  },\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-02-19T07:05:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 — Not Found",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Content brief b2c3d4e5-... not found\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Briefs for Brand",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/ideation/briefs/{{brand_id}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["ideation", "briefs", "{{brand_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve all content briefs for a specific brand.\nOptionally filter by topic with ?topic=AI"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Briefs Listed",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"7979249c-f62b-4d42-85fb-48dca9035bbc\",\n  \"count\": 2,\n  \"briefs\": [\n    {\n      \"brief_id\": \"b2c3d4e5-f678-90ab-cdef-123456789012\",\n      \"topic\": \"AI in Healthcare\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-19T07:05:00Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"brief_id\": \"d4e5f678-90ab-cdef-1234-567890123456\",\n      \"topic\": \"Digital Transformation\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-02-19T08:05:00Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Agent 3 — Execution (Content Generation)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Execute Content Generation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"brand_id\": \"{{brand_id}}\",\n  \"platforms\": [\"blog\", \"linkedin\", \"twitter\", \"email\"],\n  \"execution_mode\": \"single\",\n  \"execution_version\": \"v1\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/execute",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["execute"]
            },
            "description": "Agent 3: Generate platform-native marketing copy.\n\nAuto-fetches voice profile + latest brief from DB using brand_id.\n\nPlatforms: blog, linkedin, twitter, email (pass any subset).\n\n⚠️ LATENCY: Takes 15-45 seconds.\n⚠️ NOT SAFE TO RETRY (expensive LLM calls)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — Content Generated",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"blog\": {\n    \"title\": \"How AI Transforms Healthcare Diagnostics\",\n    \"content\": \"## What is AI in Healthcare\\n\\nArtificial intelligence is reshaping clinical workflows across the healthcare industry. From diagnostic imaging to patient data analysis, AI tools deliver measurable improvements in speed and accuracy.\\n\\n## Key Applications\\n\\nAI diagnostic tools reduce radiology reading time by 30-50%. The FDA has approved over 500 AI/ML-enabled medical devices, signaling institutional confidence in the technology.\\n\\n## Implementation Path\\n\\nIntegration requires three key steps: assessment of existing infrastructure, EHR system compatibility evaluation, and phased deployment with clinical validation.\"\n  },\n  \"linkedin\": {\n    \"post\": \"Healthcare AI is no longer theoretical. The data speaks for itself:\\n\\n📊 500+ FDA-approved AI medical devices\\n⚡ 30-50% reduction in radiology reading time\\n💰 $45B projected market by 2026\\n\\nThe question isn't whether to adopt AI in healthcare—it's how quickly you can integrate it into your clinical workflows.\\n\\nThree steps to get started:\\n1. Assess your current infrastructure\\n2. Evaluate EHR compatibility\\n3. Plan phased deployment with clinical validation\\n\\n#HealthcareAI #MedicalInnovation #DigitalHealth\"\n  },\n  \"twitter\": {\n    \"thread\": [\n      \"Healthcare AI is transforming diagnostics at scale. Here's what the data shows 🧵\",\n      \"1/ The FDA has approved 500+ AI/ML-enabled medical devices. This isn't experimental anymore.\",\n      \"2/ AI diagnostic tools cut radiology reading time by 30-50%. That's time redirected to patient care.\",\n      \"3/ The healthcare AI market hits $45B by 2026. Early adopters gain a measurable competitive edge.\",\n      \"4/ Integration starts with three steps: infrastructure assessment, EHR compatibility, phased deployment.\",\n      \"5/ The organizations acting now will define the standard of care for the next decade.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"email\": {\n    \"subject\": \"AI in Healthcare: 3 Steps to Transform Your Diagnostics\",\n    \"preview\": \"500+ FDA-approved AI devices. Here's your integration roadmap.\",\n    \"body\": \"Healthcare executives,\\n\\nAI-powered diagnostics are delivering measurable results across clinical settings. The FDA has approved over 500 AI/ML-enabled medical devices, and early adopters report 30-50% faster radiology reading times.\\n\\nHere is a three-step path to integration:\\n\\n1. Assess your current diagnostic infrastructure\\n2. Evaluate compatibility with your EHR systems\\n3. Plan a phased deployment with clinical validation metrics\\n\\nThe healthcare AI market reaches $45B by 2026. Organizations that integrate AI now gain a structural advantage in patient outcomes and operational efficiency.\",\n    \"cta\": \"Schedule a Diagnostic Assessment\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 — Missing Platforms",
